# Phase 18 compatibility release gate — 2026-10-22 03:28:21 UTC

Base revision: `d73593a9`. This entry records the request 513
`createStaticTopic` Broker RPC slice. Pinned Java source is
`efa1be59d6fc747ad220f036c86030f05f0419f9`.

## Compatibility changes

- Added `MQClientApi::create_static_topic`, mapping `TopicConfig` fields to
  `CreateTopicRequestHeader`, encoding `TopicQueueMappingDetail` as the body,
  applying configured VIP conversion and the Java timeout, and preserving
  Java's lack of local topic-permission validation.
- Extended the shared Fastjson body writer to emit integer keys in
  `hostedQueues` unquoted, matching Java alongside the existing `currIdMap`
  handling.
- Added invoked Java/Rust coverage for populated and default mapping details,
  null and empty default topics, force/order/filter fields, invalid
  permission, Broker rejection, exact body bytes, VIP routing, and timeout.
- Updated request-code and Phase 6 API/reverse-audit documentation. The
  direct-operation reverse audit now has 8 open rows; wider Phase 18 work
  remains open.

